   "title": "High Impact: SSO Login Failures - Password Reset Links Expiring & MFA Rejection",
   "description": "We are seeing a significant number of users (approx. 397 in the last hour) in our Middle East production environment unable to log in via the SSO Integration Module. Two distinct issues are occurring:\n\n1. When users request a password reset, the link provided in the email is already expired by the time they click it (within minutes).\n2. For users who do get past the login screen, the MFA codes generated by the system are being rejected as invalid, even when entered immediately.\n\nThis is severely impacting our user base. Please investigate the configuration for token TTLs and MFA validation logic urgently."
  },
