   "title": "Dev Environment: Payment Gateway v2 Schema Errors and Webhook Issues",
   "description": "Working in our US-West development environment, we are encountering problems with the Payment Gateway v2 integration.\n\nFirst, when we attempt to initialize a transaction using the standard payload, we are receiving an API schema validation error, suggesting the request format is not matching the expected definition. Second, once a transaction is successfully processed (when we bypass the schema check), the configured webhook is not firing. We have verified our endpoint is up and accepting requests from other services, but the gateway sends nothing. Please advise."
  },
  {
